        "cooked": "<p>Kindly find the snapshot of synchro eval for your reference along with test cases. Need your kind support.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">22f3002716@se2001:~/se2001/BPT2_problem_4$ synchro eval\nBPT2_problem_4: Mon Jun 30 20:01:52 UTC 2025\n---------------------\n-&gt; /opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_1\nPASS\n-&gt; /opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_2\nPASS\n-&gt; /opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_3\n2a3\n&gt;   9 Queen Yellow,thirty-five\nFAIL\nPublic Testcases Passed: 2/3\nPublic Test Cases: Evaluation failed!\nPublic Test Cases: Submission successful.\nPrivate Test Cases: No Private Testcases found.\n22f3002716@se2001:~/se2001/BPT2_problem_4$ cd\n22f3002716@se2001:~$ cd /opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_3\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_3$ ls\ninput.txt  output.txt\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_3$ cat input.txt\n**  7 Larry Silver,90**\n**  8 Mona Pink,100**\n**  9 Queen Yellow,thirty-five**\n** 10 Rick Cyan,140**\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_3$ cd ..\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public$ cd test_case_!\n-bash: cd: test_case_!: No such file or directory\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public$ cd test_case_1\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_1$ cat input.txt\nName,Age\nJohn Doe,30\nJane Smith,twenty-five\nAlice Johnson,25\nBob Brown,45\nChris Lee,thirty\nDavid Adams,40\nEve Black,50\nFrank Green,fifty-five\nGrace White,60\nHannah Young,sixty\nIan Gray,70\nJack Blue,80\nKaren Gold,eighty\nLarry Silver,90\nMona Pink,100\nNick Red,one hundred\nOscar Orange,110\nPaul Purple,120\nQueen Yellow,thirty-five\nRick Cyan,140\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_1$ cd ..\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public$ cd test_case_2\n22f3002716@se2001:/opt/se2001/BPT2_problem_4/public/test_case_2$ cat input.txt\nName,Age\nJ